OL,9,     FBritten's Les Illuminations, and
OL,10,     Fmusic by Lennox Berkeley and
OL,11,     FImogen Holst.
OL,12,G1330 Music Map
OL,13,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch explores the
OL,14,     Fmusical landscape of Gluck's Orfeo
OL,15,     Fed Euridice, from its role in
OL,16,     Fopera's development to fellow
OL,17,     Fcomposers inspired by one of
OL,18,     Fmusic's greatest legends.
