OL,5,G1500 Music Matters: Arranging the Air
OL,6,     FMartin Handley begins a four-part
OL,7,     Fseries which aims to demystify the
OL,8,     Frole of the conductor. Today, he
OL,9,     Fasks the most often asked
OL,10,     Fquestion... what does a conductor
OL,11,     Factually do?
OL,12,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,13,     FAlyn Shipton presents jazz records
OL,14,     Fof all styles as requested by you
OL,15,     Fto soundtrack your Sunday.
OL,16,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,17,     FAs the summer holidays come to an
OL,18,     Fend, and parents toast their kids'
OL,19,     Freturn to school, Hannah French
OL,20,     Fexplores JS Bach's role as a
OL,21,     Fteacher at St. Thomas Church in
OL,22,     FLeipzig.
